        472.62078857421875,
        522.4537963867188
      ],
      "text": "Co-trimoxazole prophylaxis for infants, children and adolescents living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        529.8233642578125,
        496.4305725097656,
        544.266357421875
      ],
      "text": "Co-trimoxazole prophylaxis is recommended for infants, children and adolescents with HIV,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        541.8233642578125,
        503.8390808105469,
        556.266357421875
      ],
      "text": "regardless of clinical and immune conditions. Priority should be given to all children younger",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        553.8233642578125,
        486.6790771484375,
        568.266357421875
      ],
      "text": "than 5 years old regardless of CD4 cell count or clinical stage and children with severe or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        565.8233642578125,
        494.9884948730469,
        580.266357421875
      ],
      "text": "advanced HIV clinical disease (WHO clinical stage 3 or 4) and/or those with CD4 cell count",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        577.8234252929688,
        152.27670288085938,
        592.2664184570312
      ],
      "text": "≤350 cells/mm . 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        591.2814331054688,
        303.3584899902344,
        608.4634399414062
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, high certainty evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        615.6900024414062,
        517.3370361328125,
        630.1329956054688
      ],
      "text": "In settings where malaria and/or severe bacterial infections are highly prevalent, co-trimoxazole",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        627.6900024414062,
        489.8909912109375,
        642.1329956054688
      ],
      "text": "prophylaxis should be continued until adulthood, irrespective of whether ART is provided.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        641.1478881835938,
        349.2061767578125,
        658.3298950195312
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, moderate certainty evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        665.5565185546875,
        476.3400573730469,
        679.99951171875
      ],
      "text": "In settings with low prevalence for both malaria and bacterial infections, cotrimoxazole",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        677.5565185546875,
        511.9713439941406,
        691.99951171875
      ],
      "text": "prophylaxis may be discontinued for children 5 years of age and older who are clinically stable",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        689.5565185546875,
        515.7769775390625,
        703.99951171875
      ],
      "text": "and/or virally suppressed on ART for at least six months and with a CD4 count >350 cells/mm .  3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
